artment rather than simply saying the fridge has failed. Send a clear model-label image when you contact the team."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What does a Haier fridge error code mean?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Error-code meanings depend on the refrigerator model and its control system. Photograph the exact display, note whether cooling has changed and consult the Australian manual for that model. A code should guide a qualified diagnosis, not prompt an owner to replace a board without confirming the underlying fault."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What is the call-out cost for Haier fridge repair?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "The website currently advertises call-outs from $69. The final cost of a Haier repair depends on diagnosis, labour, the appliance model and any parts required. Request an itemised quote before authorising work, and confirm the applicable warranty conditions and whether the price includes GST."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can you attend Haier repairs outside Blacktown?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "The business lists service across Blacktown and surrounding Western Sydney locations. Appointment coverage depends on the specific address and availability, so include your suburb or postcode when enquiring. The team can then advise whether a visit is possible and discuss the most suitable booking window."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Will an independent repair affect my Haier warranty?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "If the fridge is within a manufacturer or retailer warranty, review those terms and contact the warranty provider before arranging paid independent service. Do not assume every fault is covered, but do not give up potential coverage either. We do not represent this page as an authorised Haier warranty channel."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Should I replace my Haier fridge or have it inspected?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "An inspection is useful when the cause is unclear. A damaged door seal or accessible fan may be reasonable to repair, while an expensive sealed-system fault on an older cabinet can change the calculation. Compare the quoted work with replacement cost, age, reliability and any remaining warranty."}}]}]}</script>", "_css_classes": "frbw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "b811a5f", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "html_tag": "div", "css_classes": "frb-global-styles frbc"}, "elements": [{"id": "3cac6c5", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "html_tag": "header", "css_classes": "frb-site-header frbc"}, "elements": [{"id": "78930d7", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "html_tag": "div", "css_classes": "frb-header-container frbc"}, "elements": [{"id": "48119a3", "elType": "widget", "settings": {"editor": "<div class="frb-logo">
