<p style="font-size:1.08em;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.8">Tell us which compartment or function has changed rather than naming the part you suspect. Include the Haier model code, your location and any fault display, and we will talk through coverage and an appointment, then explain the options once the fridge has been assessed. Check any remaining manufacturer or retailer warranty before booking paid work.</p>
